body:
Agreed.



-----Original Message-----
From: Dasovich, Jeff 
Sent: Friday, November 09, 2001 9:21 PM
To: Mara, Susan; Steffes, James D.
Subject: FW: A.00-11-038 et al. (ALJ Pulsifer Ruling)


Seems that, at a minimum, ARM should join, if it doesn't already plan to.  And we should also consider joining ourselves, since it is low cost to do so, and pretty cost issue for our book.  Thoughts?

