-----Original Message-----
From: Dan Douglass [mailto:douglass@earthlink.net]
Sent: Sunday, November 11, 2001 9:19 PM
To: ARM
Subject: Fw: A.00-11-038 et al. (ALJ Pulsifer Ruling) - IMPORTANT !


Check this out:  apparently TURN is trying to use the proceeding dealing
with inter-utility allocation of DWR costs as a vehicle FOR ALLOCATING COSTS
TO DIRECT ACCESS CUSTOMERS.  CLECA will be filing a motion to strike on
Tuesday....AReM should join in support of that motion.

Dan

